8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:30.41,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:36.22,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:41.19,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:46.93,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation Yibis/FunimationDialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:52.36,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:57.44,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.08,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.56,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.68,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws cloaknsmokeDialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:38.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Hero Garp is...Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,protecting the platform!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get intimidated. It's just a name, you fools!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He's just an old marine.Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:55.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you're part of his generation,Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,you'd do well to pay attention to the enemy in front of you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:01.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Crimson Dog Bite!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You keep destroying the city...Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said, try to protect it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.18,Title,,0,0,230,,MonsterDialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Make a path!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,A path to Ace's rescue!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:31.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Those aggravating jerks came all the way here...Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen, you monster!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:40.87,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll show you the power of the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,To the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Fire Fist?Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Gol D. Roger?Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean Gold Roger?Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If I know him?Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you know why there's so many pirates causing trouble in the world?Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all that Roger-guy's fault!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger's...Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is just what I've heard...Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,but seems he spouted some crap about a "great treasure" just before they executed him...Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So generations of pirates stupid enough to believe him started roaming the seas.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be better if that guy was never born!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.61,Main,,0,0,0,,He's scum!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:10.44,Main,,0,0,0,,From the platform, before he died, he sent pirates out to sea to do whatever the hell they wanted!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,He was trouble when he was alive, and he's even more so now that he's dead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:17.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the worst trash in the world! Remember that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:29.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting so upset?Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, who are you anyway, you little runt?Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What were you doing down in the village, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:56.89,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a huge uproar down there because some delinquents were almost killed by a kid.Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What? And here I thought they were dead.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! When you cause trouble, I'm the one who gets blamed, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You listening to me, Ace?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:15.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! How could he push such a troublemaker on me?Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You want to know about Roger, you say?Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,He was...Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,just a liar and a murderer!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,"Pirate King"? Don't make me laugh!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He wasn't the Pirate King, more like the Bullshit King!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You can say that again!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger?Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say such disgusting names, kid. You'll spoil my beer.Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:47.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Get lost.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Why're you lookin' at me like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing, you damn brat?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.97,0:07:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking so beat down?Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been causing a lot of trouble lately.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps...Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You have a grandson, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he seem happy to you?Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm raising him well.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:37.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps.Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Was it...Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:48.37,Main,,0,0,0,,good that I was born?Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:56.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you...Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:01.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As long as you're alive, you'll figure it out eventually.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:09.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and bring Straw Hat-boy to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this, vwe'll just have to save Ace-boy vourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-chan...Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're still conscious?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I have one last favor to ask of you...Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little further! We're coming now, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:36.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Clear a path!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:56.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-san, wait for me! I will save you even if it costs me my life!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Almost there!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we come, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! We'll definitely save you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for us, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare give up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What's wrong with me?! This isn't the time to...Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:22.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops, my brother and my crew...Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,are falling, and yet...Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,"One last favor"?! Don't say such ominous things!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, give me...Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:40.26,Main,,0,0,0,,my tears won't stop...Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Even now that it's come to this...Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to live...Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:56.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, you're awake!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You're alive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You were frozen by that Aokiji-guy.Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Navy! You'd better prepare yourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'm the kind of man who'll let it end with this!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We'll get our revenge before long! I'd expect no less from you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:34.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:37.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But... what am I gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it, Magma-brat!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it to Hell...Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:57.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,So even you can't fight old age, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The one thing we'd feared the most...Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:16.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You want me to wear this equipment so the enemy will feel sorry for me or something?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:22.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle is over once you let your guard down, even for a second!Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You just got distracted, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:46.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I guess it's time for me to send you off to the next world!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.07,0:12:02.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou want another shot of the Tension Hormones?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless! Vyou and Vi fought our way out of Impel Down together, didn't vwe?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyour body has been fatally poisoned and then brought back from the brink of death...Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's way beyond its limits!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't Vi tell you before? The Tension Hormones are nothing but an emergency treatment!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,If Vi keep deceiving vyour body, vyou really will die after this is all over!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as I've done all I can,Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,then I don't mind dying!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please let me fight, Iva-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops was done in!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco! Jozu!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:06.93,Main,,0,0,0,,If... I don't fight here...Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If... I can't save Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:10.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,end up wanting to die!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please... Give me the power to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And Vi'm telling vyou...Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If Vi allow vyou to die, Vi won't be able to show my face to Dragon afterwards!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou ignorant fool!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:43.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:52.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Do whatever the hell...Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,vyou want!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! What are you doing to Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:17.97,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Straw Hat's...Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:26.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Impossible! I thought he was on the verge of death after taking Kizaru-san's attack head-on!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:34.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy, once again, you better keep in mind...Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,that the next time you drop, you won't be able to bounce back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Those guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.65,0:14:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to execute Ace again!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, my words can't change Straw Hat-boy's mind under these circumstances!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,All I can do is keep them from beating him!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:13.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:15.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish him!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not over! I won't let you pass through here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.32,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna advance...Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:49.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta beat all of us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll show you the spirit of the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Heads up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:06.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Death Wink!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.63,Main,,0,0,0,,10 points! I'll back you up!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ivan-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san...Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Koby!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! In order to live as a Navy soldier,Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to fight to change myself!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Because this is a battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:52.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to commit myself towards killing him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.41,0:17:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Bullet!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:19.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's as strong as I thought...Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are...Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,the Kuma imposters!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! What a pain in the ass!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey you, watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock. One of the Seven Warlords.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:18:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Abort attack. Friendly operative.Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! You guys are on the same side!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hancock!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,She's the Empress, right? How do you know her?Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! He called my name again...Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Move aside, Boa Hancock.Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:21.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to call my name!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Pops...Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:36.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm on my way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.23,0:18:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You are off guard!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Things don't always go the way you want!Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, Marco the Phoenix regenerates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:55.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's your turn now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Seastone?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:17.97,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks painful!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Jozu has been beaten, too!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,They even beat our commanders one by one...Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:34.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates are falling apart...Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You Fishman monster!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:46.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Now move it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, attack Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.63,0:20:08.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,These guys... do they really think...Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,they can beat me this easily?Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need any help because I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.98,0:20:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Monster!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,If I were to die...Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I know exactly...Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,what it would mean!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, you know,Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:19.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't allow myself to die until...Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I see a bright future ahead for my sons!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You just refuse to die!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.52,0:22:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:05.01,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What are they doing?! Guarding the back of Whitebeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they willing to die with Whitebeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You people will never understand!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:17.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll defend Pops' glory!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:25.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You're getting too worked up, you fools!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.93,0:23:31.09,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna see the future, I'll show you now, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:32.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:46.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That won't work!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that would stop...Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:24:00.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Behold, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.97,0:24:22.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.54,0:25:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.78,0:25:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What did vyou just do?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's... Haki?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Seriously?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.20,0:25:37.78,Main,,0,0,0,,How surprising...Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.49,0:25:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That kid...Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.80,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0